r(--accent); border: 1.5px solid var(--accent); display: inline-block; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 3px; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n.doc-header h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--heading); margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.doc-meta { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-3); }\n.section { margin-bottom: 32px; }\nh2.section-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--heading); margin-bottom: 14px; padding-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-light); display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; }\nh2.section-title .num { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); }\nul.topics { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }\nul.topics > li { padding: 10px 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--surface-alt); border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.6; }\nul.topics > li strong { color: var(--heading); font-weight: 600; }\n.decision { background: var(--surface-alt); padding: 14px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; border-radius: var(--radius); border-left: 3px solid var(--amber); }\n.decision h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--heading); margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.decision p { color: var(--text); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n.decision p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n.decision strong { color: var(--amber); font-weight: 700; margin-right: 4px; }\nul.actions { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }\nul.actions > li { padding: 10px 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--green-bg); border-left: 3px solid var(--green); font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text); }\nul.actions > li code { background: var(--surface); }\n.info-box { padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: var(--radius); margin: 10px 0; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; border-left: 3px solid; }\n.info-box p { margin: 0; color: var(--text); }\n.info-box strong { font-weight: 700; margin-right: 4px; }\n.info-box.note { border-left-color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-bg); }\n.info-box.note strong { color: var(--accent); }\n.info-box.warning { border-left-color: var(--amber); background: var(--amber-bg); }\n.info-box.warning strong { color: var(--amber); }\n.info-box.debt { border-left-color: var(--violet); background: var(--violet-bg); }\n.info-box.debt strong { color: var(--violet); }\n</style>\n\n<header class=\"doc-header\">\n  <span class=\"label\">Tech Notes</span>\n  <h1>[Beschrijvende titel van het gesprek]</h1>\n  <div class=\"doc-meta\">{{DATE}}</div>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n  <h2 class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"num\">01</span>Besproken topics</h2>\n  <ul class=\"topics\">\n    <li><strong>[Topic 1]:</strong> [Context, eventueel met <code>[ticket of pad]</code>]</li>\n    <li><strong>[Topic 2]:</strong> [Context]</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n  <h2 class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"num\">02</span>Technische beslissingen</h2>\n  <div class=\"decision\">\n    <h3>[Concrete keuze, bv. \"Postgres in plaats van DynamoDB voor session store\"]</h3>\n    <p><strong>Waarom:</strong> [Motivatie — performance, kosten, kennis in team, security]</p>\n    <p><strong>Alternatieven:</strong> [Andere opties en waarom afgevallen]</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"decision\">\n    <h3>[Volgende beslissing]</h3>\n    <p><strong>Waarom:</strong> [...]</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Alleen opnemen als er concrete taken zijn -->\n<div class=\"section\">\n  <h2 class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"num\">03</span>Action items</h2>\n  <ul class=\"actions\">\n    <li><code>@user</code> [Concrete taak] — <code>TICKET-123</code></li>\n    <li>[Taak zonder eigenaar]</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Alleen opnemen wat genoemd is; lege sectie weglaten -->\n<div class=\"section\">\n  <h2 class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"num\">04</span>Referenties &amp; risico's</h2>\n  <div class=\"info-box note\"><p><strong>Referentie:</strong> [Doc, PR of repo, met <code>link/path</code>]</p></div>\n  <div class=\"info-box warning\"><p><strong>Blocker:</strong> [Technische blocker of dependency]</p></div>\n  <div class=\"info-box debt\"><p><strong>Tech debt:</strong> [Geïdentificeerde tech debt om later op te pakken]</p></div>\n</div>"
